### Get all locations
GET http://localhost:5050/api/locations

### Get all entries
GET http://localhost:5050/api/entries

### Create a new entry
POST http://localhost:5050/api/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staffNumber": "S99999",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "surname": "User",
  "location": "Winton Building"
}

### Get one entry by staff number
GET http://localhost:5050/api/entries/S99999

### Update an entry (replace 4 with the real id from the Create response)
PUT http://localhost:5050/api/entries/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "surname": "User",
  "location": "The Stripe"
}

### Delete an entry (replace 4 with the real id)
DELETE http://localhost:5050/api/entries/5